	(text "- CLK, MOSI, and CS are the used for SPI programming of the chip.\n- CE is used to power on or off the chip. High is ON.\n- PDB_RF is used to control the output. High means there is an output.\n- LD is used to know when the VCO frequency is set. The chip makes this\n   high when the frequency is set.\n- MUXOUT is used for a lot and can be programmed, check datasheet.\n- OUTA+ and OUTA- produce outputs of the VCO. OUTA- is complementary."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 185.674 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left)
